WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.418
In tutorial 6.4, you'll check
any page before you publish it,

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:12.354
and see exactly what to fix.

00:00:13.404 --> 00:00:18.122
First, open Content, and scroll down
to Check a page before you publish.

00:00:20.379 --> 00:00:24.644
It works for any page, written here,
by your team, or with another tool.

00:00:24.694 --> 00:00:26.808
It's free, and nothing is stored.

00:00:27.822 --> 00:00:30.772
Next, type the search this
page should be found for,

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.714
the words a customer would type.

00:00:35.272 --> 00:00:38.747
Then paste the page as
plain text, or as Markdown,

00:00:38.797 --> 00:00:43.151
plain text with simple marks for
headings. Then click Check the page.

00:00:44.135 --> 00:00:47.010
The verdict says if the
page is ready to publish.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.600
This one isn't ready yet.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.385
What stops it names every reason,
like a bracket left to fill in,

00:00:54.435 --> 00:00:57.383
a title that's too long,
or a claim to confirm.

00:00:59.156 --> 00:01:02.881
Fix what it names, paste the page
again, and check it once more.

00:01:02.931 --> 00:01:06.011
When it says ready to
publish, the page can go live.

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:10.505
So, open the page check on
Content, type the search,

00:01:10.555 --> 00:01:12.814
then paste the page and read the verdict.

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:20.485
Now every page goes out ready. Next,
connect your CMS, in tutorial 6.5.
